@startuml
title Describe Environment Deployment Diagram - CV Tajuk Revenue Cycle Information System

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "User\n(Sales / Admin / Manager)" as User

cloud "GitHub\n<<source control>>" as GitHub

cloud "Vercel\n<<hosting platform>>" as Vercel {
  node "Next.js Application\n<<server runtime>>" as App
  artifact "Prisma Client" as Prisma
}

cloud "Supabase\n<<backend platform>>" as Supabase {
  database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB
  artifact "Storage Bucket\ncustomer PO-documents" as Storage
}

artifact "Browser Print / PDF" as Print
artifact "Excel Workbook Export" as Excel

User --> App : HTTPS browser interaction
GitHub --> Vercel : Git deployment trigger
App --> Prisma : Server-side data access
Prisma --> DB : PostgreSQL queries
App --> Storage : PO upload/download
App --> Print : Printable Invoice / Surat Jalan
App --> Excel : Sales Order / Customer PO export

note right of App
Vercel requires environment variables:
DATABASE_URL, DIRECT_URL, AUTH_SECRET,
SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
and SUPABASE_CUSTOMER_PO_BUCKET.
end note

@enduml
